# Omni - nvim (actions/nvim/nvim_omni.kbd)
**omni + omni**     -- Cancel
**omni + spc**      -- Seek Spc
**omni + bcsp**     -- Delete
**omni + a**        -- Select All
**omni + b**        -- Pgup
**omni + c**        -- Copy
**omni + lsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + rsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + d**        -- Duplicate
**omni + f**        -- Pgdn
**omni + h**        -- Cursor Left
**omni + j**        -- Cursor Down
**omni + k**        -- Cursor Up
**omni + l**        -- Cursor Right
**omni + m**        -- Clipboard History
**omni + n**        -- New
**omni + lsft + n** -- New Folder
**omni + o**        -- Tag Follow
**omni + p**        -- Tag Back
**omni + q**        -- Quit
**omni + r**        -- Rename
**omni + s**        -- Sort
**omni + lsft + s** -- Sort Reverse
**omni + t**        -- New Tab
**omni + lsft + t** -- Undo Tab
**omni + u**        -- Remove Duplicates
**omni + v**        -- Paste
**omni + w**        -- Close Tab
**omni + x**        -- Cut
**omni + y**        -- History Commands
**omni + z**        -- Undo
**omni + lsft + z** -- Redo
**omni + 0**        -- Tab Goto 0
**omni + 1**        -- Tab 1
**omni + 2**        -- Tab 2
**omni + 3**        -- Tab 3
**omni + 4**        -- Tab 4
**omni + 5**        -- Tab 5
**omni + 6**        -- Tab 6
**omni + 7**        -- Tab 7
**omni + 8**        -- Tab 8
**omni + 9**        -- Tab 9
**omni + ]**        -- Forward
**omni + [**        -- Back
**omni + \**        -- Compare Toggle
**omni + ;**        -- Comment
**omni + ,**        -- Settings
**omni + .**        -- Tags
**omni + /**        -- Help
**omni + !lmet**    -- Desktops Toggle
**omni + !lalt**    -- Panes Toggle
**omni + !lctl**    -- Tabs Toggle
**omni + ralt**     -- Apps Toggle
**omni + prnt**     -- Groups Toggle
**omni + rctl**     -- Sessions Toggle
